empt's outcome. If the last word was "doing," then D is still the best fit. Since I cannot hear the audio beyond the provided transcript, I rely on the structure implied by the previous interaction.\n\nThe last word spoken by the narrator before the next speaker (Johan) began was likely the final word of the phrase "doing things."\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{D}$
